### Demo Payment Service health
GET http://localhost:8090/actuator/health


### Current failure mode
GET http://localhost:8090/simulate/failure-mode


### Set HIGH_LATENCY mode
POST http://localhost:8090/simulate/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "HIGH_LATENCY",
  "latencyMs": 2500,
  "failureRate": 0.0
}


### Set RANDOM_FAILURES mode
POST http://localhost:8090/simulate/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "RANDOM_FAILURES",
  "latencyMs": 0,
  "failureRate": 1.0
}


### Set TIMEOUTS mode
POST http://localhost:8090/simulate/failure-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "TIMEOUTS",
  "latencyMs": 3000,
  "failureRate": 0.0
}


### Recover payment service
POST http://localhost:8090/simulate/recovery


### Charge payment
POST http://localhost:8090/payments/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-123",
  "amount": 49.99,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "correlationId": "checkout-req-001"
}


### Check IncidentHub signals
GET http://localhost:8080/signals?limit=10